# Smart Password Security Analyzer

A frontend-based password generator and security analyzer built using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

## Features

- Random password generation
- Custom password length
- Uppercase/lowercase selection
- Number and special character support
- Password strength analysis
- Security suggestions
- Copy password feature
- Password history
- Responsive UI

## Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript

